@alpu8007@gmail.com I would suggest you can divide the function based on fcs type or mts type and based on that you can call one of the two function "ExpandFcsTypeLocationCode" and "ExpandMtsTypeLocationCode" which can handle expanding the respective location codes.
Inside those methods you can directly do Dbus calls to read respective keywords.

This will save extraction of these keywords and at the same time these extra fitting functions won't be required.
